ker appearing near 334) is a minor detail that cannot be conclusively verified due to the popup obscuring listing prices; the key answer ($58 cheapest) is verified.\n\n## Verdict\nBoth parts of the task were completed: the next game (vs Trail Blazers, 10/28 at 11:00 AM) was correctly identified from ESPN, and the ticket site (Vivid Seats) was reached via ESPN, with the cheapest ticket correctly identified as $58.\n\n**SUCCESS**",
